um.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Shuhei Takahashi &lt;nya@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Hidehiko Abe &lt;hidehiko@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="1" gerrit_number="1273236" owner_email="hashimoto@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/changes/36/1273236/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="1"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ic026948539ce854d271420220c3edc2ced6a5b5e" commit="2b7d406ea4eac3fec4711f19f39a56937c54e952" commit_message="video_WebRtcMediaRecorder: Follow the latest AudioContext API  https://crrev.com/c/1069692 changes around AudioContext API. This follows the API change. I change them referring the change to //content/test/data/media/mediarecorder_test.html in https://crrev.com/c/1069692.  BUG=None TEST=video_WebRtcMediaRecorder on veyron_minnie  Change-Id: Ic026948539ce854d271420220c3edc2ced6a5b5e Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/1275666 Commit-Ready: Hirokazu Honda &lt;hiroh@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Hirokazu Honda &lt;hiroh@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Shuo-Peng Liao &lt;deanliao@google.com&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="1275666" owner_email="hiroh@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/changes/66/1275666/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I3587ee4a4a83de1bfe8a053f628398e872070599" commit="0fd0aebd6cde975b3d76ebb11507264cd9fa8d79" commit_message="ippusb_manager: Removing duplicate syscall from arm seccomp filter  The arm seccomp policy filter contained both the &quot;ARM_set_tls&quot; and &quot;set_tls&quot; syscalls, the latter of which was causing a seccomp failure. This change removes the duplicate.  BUG=chromium:893374 TEST=Tested manually on veyron_minnie and dru devices  Change-Id: I358